{"id":1611,"date":"2025-08-20T08:31:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-20T08:31:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/?p=1611"},"modified":"2025-08-20T08:53:36","modified_gmt":"2025-08-20T08:53:36","slug":"outdoor-digital-signage-in-ireland","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/outdoor-digital-signage-in-ireland\/","title":{"rendered":"Outdoor Digital Signage in Ireland"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1611\" class=\"elementor elementor-1611\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4635d0f3 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4635d0f3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f03894 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4f03894\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>When it comes to <strong>outdoor digital signage<\/strong> in <strong>Ireland<\/strong>, you&#8217;re not just installing a screen \u2014 you&#8217;re investing in a communication tool that must perform in some of the most unpredictable weather conditions in Europe. From sideways rain in Galway to wind tunnels in Dublin city centre, outdoor screens need to be <strong>weatherproof, vandal-resistant, and visible in all lighting conditions<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1612\" src=\"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"outdoor-digital-signage-ireland\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-650x1300.jpg 650w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-1300x1300.jpg 1300w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Untitled-design-7-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1px) 100vw, 1px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Whether you\u2019re a <strong>local council<\/strong>, <strong>public transport operator<\/strong>, or <strong>commercial property manager<\/strong>, this guide walks you through the key factors to consider when selecting outdoor digital signage for the Irish environment.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Outdoor Digital Signage Matters in Ireland<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><strong>Outdoor digital signage<\/strong> is used to inform, advertise, and engage the public in real time. It&#8217;s commonly deployed in:<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Town centres and high streets<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Train stations and bus shelters<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tourist attractions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Retail parks and drive-thrus<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Car parks and campuses<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>These displays can show everything from public safety announcements to interactive wayfinding, schedules, and digital ads.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>A growing trend:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>According to IAB Ireland, <strong>digital out-of-home (DOOH) advertising spend<\/strong> rose by over <strong>23% in 2024<\/strong>, with councils and transport infrastructure playing a major role.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>As more public and commercial spaces go digital, choosing the <strong>right outdoor signage solution<\/strong> is critical \u2014 especially in Ireland\u2019s weather-heavy climate.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Weatherproofing: Built for the Irish Climate<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Irish weather is known for being wet, windy, and highly variable \u2014 sometimes all in the same hour. That\u2019s why outdoor digital signage in Ireland must be <strong>IP-rated<\/strong>, durable, and tested for harsh conditions.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Requirements:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>IP65 or higher<\/strong>: Fully sealed against rain, dust, and condensation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Temperature-regulated<\/strong>: Operates reliably in -20\u00b0C to +50\u00b0C environments<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Anti-corrosion coatings<\/strong>: For coastal towns or salt-exposed roads<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Self-regulating ventilation or heaters<\/strong>: Prevents screen fogging or component failure<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Toughened glass &amp; sealed enclosures<\/strong>: For long-term performance and public safety<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>At <strong>Interactive Displays Ireland<\/strong>, our outdoor screens are rated for full <strong>24\/7 operation<\/strong>, engineered to survive Irish winters and summers without a hitch.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Brightness &amp; Visibility: Always Clear, Day or Night<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>In outdoor settings, screen brightness is <strong>the most overlooked yet most important<\/strong> factor. Standard commercial displays (300\u2013500 nits) are unreadable in daylight. For <strong>Irish outdoor signage<\/strong>, you need:<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Recommended Brightness:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Minimum 2,500\u20133,500 nits<\/strong> for direct sunlight areas<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Auto-brightness sensors<\/strong> to adjust for evening\/night use<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Anti-glare glass<\/strong> and high contrast ratios for legibility<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Use Case Example:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>A local authority in Mayo installed 55\u201d high-brightness displays in a public transport hub. With automated brightness control and weatherproof casing, the screens deliver real-time departure information <strong>365 days a year<\/strong>, no matter the weather.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Compliance &amp; Safety: Meeting Irish Regulations<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Public installations, especially in <strong>council areas<\/strong> or near roads, must meet planning and safety guidelines.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Compliance Essentials:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>CE certification<\/strong> for electronic equipment<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Planning permission<\/strong> for permanent signage (especially with advertising content)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Low-glare or night-mode<\/strong> for roadside installations<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Secure anti-vandal casings<\/strong> with locking systems<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>WEEE-compliant disposal and recycling<\/strong> for old equipment<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>We work closely with councils and planners across Ireland to ensure installations are <strong>fully compliant and risk-assessed<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Connectivity &amp; Content Control<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Outdoor digital signage is only as good as its content \u2014 and how easily you can control it.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>That\u2019s where our in-house CMS,<a href=\"https:\/\/screenfusion.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <strong>screenfusion.ai<\/strong><\/a>, comes in. With it, you can:<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Schedule content remotely<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Update screens across multiple towns or departments<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Monitor uptime and receive performance alerts<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Integrate live feeds (e.g. weather, travel info, or local news)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>This is especially valuable for councils, tourism boards, and public safety networks that need to <strong>respond in real time<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Mounting &amp; Location: Get It Right from the Start<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Poor screen placement can ruin even the most advanced signage system. We offer full <strong>site assessments<\/strong> and recommend:<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table --><\/p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\n<table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Mounting Option<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Ideal For<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Freestanding Totems<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Town centres, parks, car parks<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Wall-Mounted Units<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Building exteriors, bus shelters<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Pole-Mounted Displays<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Roadside, transport stops, campuses<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/figure>\n<p><!-- \/wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>All units are installed by our <strong>certified technicians<\/strong> with attention to:<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Power supply protection<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Weather-sealed cabling<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Grounding and lightning protection<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Accessibility (for content servicing)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Case Studies: Outdoor Signage Success Across Ireland<\/strong><strong>D\u00fan Laoghaire\u2013Rathdown Council<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Installed a set of <strong>interactive outdoor digital kiosks<\/strong> in local parks to share event listings, safety notices, and wayfinding. The screens are solar-powered with anti-vandal enclosures.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Irish Rail Pilot<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Using 55\u201d weatherproof screens to test real-time train departures, station alerts, and emergency messages in high-traffic locations like Connolly and Heuston.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Retail Park in Limerick<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Freestanding double-sided outdoor screens at the entrance to a shopping park display promotions, opening times, and public transport info \u2014 updated centrally using <strong>screenfusion.ai<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragr